    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/e5f7bbfa385500fa0080eaa68b60c9a6.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/387972475f13d65f850ccfcc590443d3.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Fringe</strong> is a grim hardcore tactical RPG set in a biopunk wasteland. Explore a hand-crafted pixel nightmare that blends the nostalgic charm of classic strategy games with tactical freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/4aa5a59088254153c5fb7b9d2a11f85b.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate and transform spaces; modify, destroy, or replace grid elements to exploit terrain height and effects, gaining tactical advantages by strategically positioning your squad.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/048b39465202832636dafb610cac784b.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/048b39465202832636dafb610cac784b.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/048b39465202832636dafb610cac784b.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/5afdf8214eefd2ed8d4d8344b604773d.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront unimaginable foes: toxic tumors, spores, larva swarms, and bio-technologically modified enemies await. Explore this grim, low-fantasy world, challenging fearsome creatures or dangerous mercenaries. Wage war against rival factions and obliterate your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/97b29f37f00508e55c83bc5918c4ccda.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/97b29f37f00508e55c83bc5918c4ccda.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/97b29f37f00508e55c83bc5918c4ccda.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/9cdde28a69d29d29a2cddfcf2982f100.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unique character compositions with devastating firepower, and upgrade their arsenal to get the most out of their abilities and dominate each encounter. Strategically, add powerful item upgrades and track your stats before entering the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/83b129c906bf4a4a1ce72429d3514329.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/83b129c906bf4a4a1ce72429d3514329.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/83b129c906bf4a4a1ce72429d3514329.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/27483375de521c91b317a0af79a76350.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle ultra-large units that control multiple grids, capable of unleashing devastating attacks and altering the flow of battle.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/19dae55e10f1ada40089b96562aa6847.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/19dae55e10f1ada40089b96562aa6847.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/19dae55e10f1ada40089b96562aa6847.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/e59cd71a8613bbff6870f853fea16633.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ the built-in graphical editor to easily create your own levels, characters, and campaigns, with ALL GAME ASSETS AVAILABLE! Share your creations with players worldwide through the workshop and experience limitless adventures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/ef1ee132f117b97a5f0503547441128a.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/ef1ee132f117b97a5f0503547441128a.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/ef1ee132f117b97a5f0503547441128a.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/d27f981911458dc06b9bf6eb8b0768c7.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into dangerous endless territories, uncovering the secrets of the apocalypse that changed the world forever and the histories of rival factions with each expedition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/bd8e49749298f9c7bb3cd884eb5a4df5.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/bd8e49749298f9c7bb3cd884eb5a4df5.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/bd8e49749298f9c7bb3cd884eb5a4df5.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/68b754ab06c5e4808dc1f16446d097fd.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span>Encounter a variety of characters and factions. Form alliances or incite rivalries, making strategic choices that forge your path and shape your story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/7b9a34403bf00b9b8fc4941fa28fa939.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/7b9a34403bf00b9b8fc4941fa28fa939.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/7b9a34403bf00b9b8fc4941fa28fa939.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/387972475f13d65f850ccfcc590443d3.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Fringe</strong> is a grim hardcore tactical RPG set in a biopunk wasteland. Explore a hand-crafted pixel nightmare that blends the nostalgic charm of classic strategy games with tactical freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/4aa5a59088254153c5fb7b9d2a11f85b.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate and transform spaces; modify, destroy, or replace grid elements to exploit terrain height and effects, gaining tactical advantages by strategically positioning your squad.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/048b39465202832636dafb610cac784b.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/048b39465202832636dafb610cac784b.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/048b39465202832636dafb610cac784b.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/5afdf8214eefd2ed8d4d8344b604773d.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront unimaginable foes: toxic tumors, spores, larva swarms, and bio-technologically modified enemies await. Explore this grim, low-fantasy world, challenging fearsome creatures or dangerous mercenaries. Wage war against rival factions and obliterate your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/97b29f37f00508e55c83bc5918c4ccda.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/97b29f37f00508e55c83bc5918c4ccda.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/97b29f37f00508e55c83bc5918c4ccda.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/9cdde28a69d29d29a2cddfcf2982f100.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unique character compositions with devastating firepower, and upgrade their arsenal to get the most out of their abilities and dominate each encounter. Strategically, add powerful item upgrades and track your stats before entering the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/83b129c906bf4a4a1ce72429d3514329.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/83b129c906bf4a4a1ce72429d3514329.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/83b129c906bf4a4a1ce72429d3514329.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/27483375de521c91b317a0af79a76350.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle ultra-large units that control multiple grids, capable of unleashing devastating attacks and altering the flow of battle.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/19dae55e10f1ada40089b96562aa6847.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/19dae55e10f1ada40089b96562aa6847.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/19dae55e10f1ada40089b96562aa6847.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/e59cd71a8613bbff6870f853fea16633.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ the built-in graphical editor to easily create your own levels, characters, and campaigns, with ALL GAME ASSETS AVAILABLE! Share your creations with players worldwide through the workshop and experience limitless adventures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/ef1ee132f117b97a5f0503547441128a.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extr