e_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/7b9a34403bf00b9b8fc4941fa28fa939.poster.avif?t=1755226487\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/7b9a34403bf00b9b8fc4941fa28fa939.webm?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067920/extras/7b9a34403bf00b9b8fc4941fa28fa939.mp4?t=1755226487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
